# Build context is the directory holding the framegrade, gps-journey and
# waypost checkouts side by side; patterns are relative to it.
# A checkout's virtualenv can be several GB, and `COPY framegrade` would carry
# it into the image, bloating the image and making the layer export take many
# minutes. The image pip-installs its own packages, so host virtualenvs and
# caches never belong in it.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/htmlcov
